Recommends: plasma-workspace,
Description: stretch one wallpaper seamlessly across all your monitors
 WallStitch reads your monitor layout, lets you position an image visually,
 then cuts it into one perfectly aligned piece per screen and sets them as
 your wallpaper.
 .
 Features include any monitor layout (multi-monitor, ultrawide, stacked,
 mixed resolutions, HiDPI), bezel compensation, random wallpapers from
 wallhaven.cc sized for your desktop, a synced spanning slideshow of up to 50
 images, restoring your previous wallpaper, and a command-line interface.
 .
 KDE Plasma 6 is supported.
